	(text "K1 feeds the heaters ONLY. Fans and logic stay powered so cooldown works in FAULT.\nFirmware closes K1 only in PREHEAT/RUN, before any gate turns on, and opens it on\nany fault after the gates are low (switch without load). Default OFF: 10k pull-down.\nBackstop for a shorted heater MOSFET (FMEA FM-01, action A2, ADR-013)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 80 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
