	(text "TCO + PTC are OFF-BOARD on the duct (on_board = no). TCO in series with each heater.\n10k gate pull-downs are MANDATORY (FM-04): heater off at boot/reset/floating pin.\nIRLB8721: R_DS(on) is specified at V_GS = 4.5 V, not 3.3 V. Confirm on the bench or\nadd a gate driver before full load (FMEA action A3)."
