	(text "Fan power and logic come from 12V_AUX, NOT from the relay: fans must run during FAULT.\n10k/10k divider holds AO3401A V_GS at about -6 V (part limit is +/-12 V).\nFan PWM is inverted (GPIO high = fan slower); invert only in the HAL.\nTach filter is 10 nF: 10k x 100 nF would smear ~450 Hz pulses at full speed.\nFans M1/M2 are off-board in the duct."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 210 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7d632b2c-1a98-5371-8097-9c0ff7f35dc9")
	)
