	(text "Pin map source of truth: firmware/include/config.h + docs/04-wiring.md.\nHeater gates never on GPIO 0, 2, 5, 12, 14, 15. IO17 drives the master relay.\nI2C pull-ups are on the SHT40/OLED breakouts. Encoder uses ESP32 internal pull-ups.\nJ10 carries a servo signal; an exhaust fan would need its own driver."
